{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgywt3ExoKUUxuwLWntjS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. I think I'm meant to find Tilts-The-Jug, who Plaits-The-Reed said could use careful hands in a house on Soulrest dock. That was the only lead I got. I never reached them, so I'm guessing. I was also told I'd begin in Never-Sold's house with the Rows-For-Another story behind me, and the game never picked that up. Maybe I should have been back in Blackrose reporting to Never-Sold, but nothing in the game pointed there.\n\n2. Nobody, as far as the game showed me. My journal was empty the whole time. I was told I work through the Chainbreakers and Never-Sold, but that never appeared in the game. No one I met mentioned it, and no quest recorded it. I had no employer and no reason to follow any one thread.\n\n3. The most confusing moment was the first `look`. I expected to be in Never-Sold's house after the Rows-For-Another decision. Instead I was on a dock in Soulrest with strangers and no journal entries. After that, it was confusing that `go` accepted only people standing near me. It refused Tilts-The-Jug, Soulrest and the landmarks from my directions. I couldn't tell whether I was doing something wrong or whether the game had no way to get there.\n\n4. First, make the opening match the premise: if the story starts in Never-Sold's house, put me there and give me a journal entry. Second, when an NPC names a lead like Tilts-The-Jug, add it to the journal or the map, or make the name work with `go`. A lead I can't act on leaves me stuck. Third, tell me how to move between areas, or list reachable destinations in `look`. Fourth, the NPCs have charm, such as the Dunmer outcast and Little-Gecko asking if I smile, but several were silent or gave only generic topics. Even one or two with real information and a next step would help a lot."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3507,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3507},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19e254da-e4eb-4082-bf26-b848855d4e85","uuid":"67a16b83-d45e-47fe-8c9e-f2ea06f0b422","timestamp":"2026-11-13T00:02:57.129Z","request_id":"req_011Cgywt381mYb9vteu6ZbUm"}
